  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Complementing support to the studie on district heating in Gattjina in Russia. Evaluation and analysis to develop a short-term action programme-alternative based on donations, to make it possible to go through with the proposal presented by the consultantgroup &#xc5;F International (401/97) concerning changes in district heating.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fj&#xe4;rrv&#xe4;rmestudie i Gattjina; kompletterande insats. Studie f&#xf6;r att ta fram ett g&#xe5;vobaserat handlingsalternativ p&#xe5; kort sikt f&#xf6;r att g&#xf6;ra det m&#xf6;jligt att inleda genomf&#xf6;randet av det f&#xf6;rslag som konsultinsatsen (401/97, &#xc5;F International) lagt fram ang&#xe5;ende f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar vg fj&#xe4;rrv&#xe4;rmesystemet i Gattjina, Ryssland.</narrative>
  </description>
